[0.008, "o", "\u001b[1mOur top 10 customers have each spent over $1,350 lifetime, driven by repeat orders of high-ticket \u001b[0m  \r\n\u001b[1mitems well above the store average.\u001b[0m                                                                 \r\n\r\n\u001b[36m                                                                                        \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mCustomer ID (Hashed)\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mCountry\u001b[0m\u001b[1m      \u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mTotal Spend\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mOrders\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mItems Bought\u001b[0m\u001b[1m \u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mAvg Item Price\u001b[0m\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40m2be09ad90a94\u001b[0m         \u001b[36m \u001b[0mChina         \u001b[36m \u001b[0m$1,660.73   \u001b[36m \u001b[0m4      \u001b[36m \u001b[0m7            \u001b[36m \u001b[0m$237.25       \u001b[36m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m \u001b[0m"]
